# Project: PHP Gallery
# Repository: https://github.com/klusik/PHP_gallery
#
# File: data/gallery-trash/.htaccess
# Module Type: Web Server Configuration
#
# Purpose:
#   Prevents direct HTTP access to recoverable gallery trash payloads.
#
# Responsibilities:
#   - Keep deleted gallery files behind authenticated Admin restore/purge routes
#   - Prevent guessed trash tokens, manifests, and original media from being served
#
# Author:
#   Rudolf Klusal
#
# Contact:
#   https://github.com/klusik
#
# License:
#   MIT License (see LICENSE file in repository)
#
# Notes:
#   - Runtime trash payloads are user data and are never updater-owned.
#   - Keep comments and docstrings intact when modifying this file.
#
# Last Updated:
#   2026-09-07

Require all denied
